  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EMERGENCY SHELTER AND WASH INTERVENTION FOR CONFLICT-AFFECTED INTERNALLY DISPLACED PEOPLE IN CABO DELGADO PROVINCE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x2018;Emergency Shelter and WASH Intervention for Conflict-Affected Internally Displaced People in Cabo Delgado Province&#x2019; project, aims to ensure the most vulnerable conflict-affected households (HHs) in Cabo Delgado can meet their basic household needs through access to adequate shelter, water and sanitation facilities through the construction of key related infrastructure and one Market shelter. The objectives of the grant are to provide WASH and shelter support for at least 14,300 people in Quissanga and Macomia. Key activities include: building shelter and improved latrines, build 1 market shelter, improve WASH facilities (i.e. water points, latrine blocks for women, family latrines) provide emergency Shelter/WASH needs through the Crisis Modifier</narrative>
  </description>
